NGCC ReSolveD-alpha Submission
==============================

Algorithm: ReSolveD-alpha, a post-quantum digital signature scheme based on
the VOLE-in-the-head framework.

This package combines the portable reference implementation and the optimized
x86-64 implementation required by the NGCC public-key algorithm submission
instructions.

Directory Structure:
resolved-alpha/
